ry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[141.64716637,43.93400513]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"浜中運動公園","category":"nature","address":"留萌市","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"01212","municipality_pref":"北海道","municipality_name":"留萌市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[141.63550024,43.92350727]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"錦町公園","category":"nature","address":"留萌市","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"01212","municipality_pref":"北海道","municipality_name":"留萌市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[141.64979974,43.93926437]}}],"display_comment_original":"留萌市では、留萌村、礼受村、三泊村などの歴史地名から土地の成り立ちをたどれる。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡に関わる場所が見え、留萌灯台、永福寺、光明寺のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、留萌村、礼受村に関わる地名碑や地域の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の由緒を示す歴史案内板も見つかるかもしれない。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["原田栄一","五十嵐悦郎","長沼憲彦","佐藤勝","鹿内信隆"],"honorary_citizens":["原田栄一","五十嵐悦郎","長沼憲彦"],"tourism_landmarks":["暑寒別天売焼尻国定公園","旧留萌佐賀家漁場（国の史跡）","黄金岬（おうごんみさき）…夕陽の名所","留萌市海のふるさと館","ゴールデンビーチるもい…道北エリア最大級の海水浴場","千望台…留萌市内を一望","礼受牧場","道の駅るもい"],"specialties":["ニシン","数の子","にしんそば","にしんパイ"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%95%99%E8%90%8C%E5%B8%82","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q110404159","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q100454760","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q110404088","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q938538","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11174965","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q17228109","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q6605252","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11317574","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%B0%E6%A0%84%E4%B8%80&keyword=%E7%95%99%E8%90%8C%E5%B8%82"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"留萌市","wikipedia_revision_id":"11012934